Error [E0059]: the taint-strip modifier is written `#Sanitizer`, not bare `sanitizer`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_sanitizer_keyword.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | sanitizer fn clean(raw: String) -> String {
    | ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Sanitizer` is a marker, like every other `#`-tag, so the taint-strip contract draws the eye
 Fix: write: #Sanitizer fn name() { ... }
